flowchart LR
  START[job starts] --> CP{checkpoint exists?}
  CP -->|yes| RESUME[resume at completed_units]
  CP -->|no| FRESH[start fresh]
  RESUME --> WORK[do next unit]
  FRESH --> WORK
  WORK --> SAVE[atomic checkpoint write]
  SAVE --> CRASH{interrupted?}
  CRASH -->|yes| START
  CRASH -->|no| MORE{more units?}
  MORE -->|yes| WORK
  MORE -->|no| DONE[complete, no duplicate work]
